# EAS Build upload rules (eas-cli reads this from the git root and, when it
# exists, ignores every .gitignore). Allowlist: upload only the Android app's
# sources. Everything else - including .env credentials, the Python server
# and the desktop app - is never sent to EAS.
/*
!/control4-android

# Generated / local-only inside the app. Native folders are always
# generated from app.json + config plugins by EAS prebuild.
/control4-android/android
/control4-android/ios
/control4-android/node_modules
/control4-android/.expo
/control4-android/dist
/control4-android/web-build

# Never upload secrets or binaries, wherever they are.
**/.env
**/.env.*
**/*.jks
**/*.keystore
**/*.p8
**/*.p12
**/*.key
**/*.pem
**/*.apk
**/*.aab
**/*.jar
